    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1704">

                <pb facs="1085" n="969" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg969"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.812/102b.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Jefferson.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 16, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Senate Committee favorably reported Nicaraguan treaty to-day. Hope to secure
                    consideration in the Senate soon after holidays.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
